# Prettier walks the FILESYSTEM, not the git index, so a path being gitignored
# is not enough — anything that stays on disk but must not be reformatted has to
# be listed here too. (Prettier 3 does read .gitignore by default, but relying
# on that couples formatting to publication decisions; keep this list explicit.)

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated / vendored code — reformatting it is churn at best
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1,001 files exported from openai/codex by scripts/codegen-codex.mjs, every one
# stamped "GENERATED CODE! DO NOT MODIFY BY HAND!". Formatting them produces a
# diff that the next codegen run reverts.
apps/desktop/src/engine/agents/adapters/codex/generated/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lockfiles
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pnpm-lock.yaml
apps/control-plane/pnpm-lock.yaml
apps/marketing/pnpm-lock.yaml
apps/web/package-lock.json

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output and installed trees
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist*/
out/
release/
binaries/
coverage/
.codex-protocol-cache/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hand-formatted HTML/Markdown — the layout is the content
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The design labs are single-file HTML documents that open straight off
# file://; their indentation encodes the structure of the mock, and Prettier's
# HTML printer rewraps it into something no one can read as a design.
# `styles/Artifacts/` is the tracked design record. `.context/` is local-only
# working material. Durable Markdown under `docs/` is intentionally formatted
# and therefore is not exempted here.
styles/Artifacts/
.context/
